      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>All pixel data is replaced by a pseudo-random sequence generated from a PN9 512-bit sequence (typically implemented in hardware with a linear feedback shift register).</para>
          <para>The generator should be reset at the beginning of each frame, and thus each subsequent raw frame with this test pattern should be exactly the same as the last.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/camera2/CameraMetadata#SENSOR_TEST_PATTERN_MODE_PN9" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.camera2.CameraMetadata.SENSOR_TEST_PATTERN_MODE_PN9</code>.</a></format></para>
