      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Each pixel in [R, G_even, G_odd, B] is replaced by its respective color channel provided in android.sensor.testPatternData.</para>
          <code lang="text/java">android.sensor.testPatternData = [0, 0xFFFFFFFF, 0xFFFFFFFF, 0]</code>
          <para>All green pixels are 100% green. All red/blue pixels are black.</para>
          <code lang="text/java">android.sensor.testPatternData = [0xFFFFFFFF, 0, 0xFFFFFFFF, 0]</code>
          <para>All red pixels are 100% red. Only the odd green pixels are 100% green. All blue pixels are 100% black.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/camera2/CameraMetadata#SENSOR_TEST_PATTERN_MODE_SOLID_COLOR" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.camera2.CameraMetadata.SENSOR_TEST_PATTERN_MODE_SOLID_COLOR</code>.</a></format></para>
